          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Deng Xiaoping</strong><br>\nDeng Xiaoping was born on August 22, 1904, in Sichuan Province, China. From a young age, he was exposed to the revolutionary undercurrents against the imperial Qing Dynasty. At 16, he traveled to France to study and work, where he became involved with the Chinese Communist Youth League. This experience shaped his future in politics as he began to firmly believe in communist ideals.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rise in the Communist Party</strong><br>\nAfter returning to China, Deng quickly rose through the ranks of the Communist Party. He participated in the Long March, a significant event in Communist Party history, and held various important posts in the government. Deng's intelligence and political skills helped him navigate the complex landscape of Chinese politics during the years of consolidation under Mao Zedong.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Economic Policies and Reforms</strong><br>\nFollowing Mao's death in 1976, Deng became China's paramount leader. He initiated the \"Reform and Opening Up\" policy, transitioning the country towards a market economy. Under his leadership, China saw significant economic growth and improvement in people's living standards. Deng's policies were credited with modernizing China's economy and leading it onto the world stage.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
